# Secrets. config.toml holds a Discord token, proxies.txt holds proxy
# credentials. The .bak patterns matter as much as the originals: `python -m
# rsb migrate` writes config.toml.bak, and a backup of a secret is still a
# secret.
config.toml
config.toml.bak
proxies.txt
proxies.txt.bak
*.bak

# Scan results contain personal data and expire after 24h.
exports/

# Design and product notes stay local. They are working documents about how the
# page and the product were arrived at, not part of what the project ships.
DESIGN.md
PRODUCT.md
.impeccable/

.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
